  "title": "Activist Stakes"
 },
 "description": "Returns SEC Schedule 13D/13G large-ownership filings. With no identity filter, returns the global recent-filing feed; optionally filter by one stock or one filer.\n\nWHEN TO USE: User asks who has taken a big stake in a company, or whether an activist investor is involved.\nExamples:\n  - \"Who has a 5%+ stake in Tesla?\"\n  - \"Is there an activist investor in NVDA?\"\n  - \"Show recent active 13D/13G stakes\"\n\nPARAMETERS:\n  - ticker_or_cusip or filer: optional identity filter; provide at most one. Ticker collisions return candidates; use an exact CUSIP to disambiguate\n  - classification: optional active, passive, structural, or unknown filter\n  - filed_from / filed_to: optional inclusive SEC filing-date range (YYYY-MM-DD); filed_from must be on or before filed_to\n  - limit / cursor: page size and opaque continuation cursor; an explicit limit above the caller's tier fails rather than being changed\n\nThe result preserves unknown structural classifications instead of converting them to passive.\n\nWHEN NOT TO USE:\n  - Use get_insider_trades for officer/director Form 4 trades\n  - Use analyze_stock for the synthesized smart-money verdict\n\nRETURNS: Cursor-paginated stakes with canonical and source-reported security identity, filer, current and previous ownership, voting power, classification, form, stated purpose, filing identifiers, and source link. Stock filters include exact-CUSIP rows plus official subject-ticker evidence not yet linked to a CUSIP; those rows return cusip null and data_status identifies the limitation.\n\nVERIFICATION: Cite record-level `source_url` filing or disclosure links when present.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "not": {
   "anyOf": [
    {
     "required": [
      "ticker_or_cusip",
      "filer"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  "properties": {
   "classification": {
    "enum": [
     "active",
     "passive",
     "structural",
     "unknown"
    ],
    "type": "string"
   },
   "cursor": {
    "maxLength": 500,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "filed_from": {
    "format": "date",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "filed_to": {
    "format": "date",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "filer": {
    "maxLength": 80,
    "minLength": 1,
    "type": "string"
   },
   "limit": {
    "maximum": 50,
    "minimum": 1,
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "ticker_or_cusip": {
    "maxLength": 20,
    "minLength": 1,
    "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9./\\-]+$",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "get_activist_stakes",
